Package: terminal.mk-dl
Version: 1.1.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-requests, python3-tk
Maintainer: terminal.mk <support@terminal.mk>
Homepage: https://github.com/terminal-mk/downloader
Description: Batch downloader for terminal.mk filing attachments
 Companion app for terminal.mk's CF (Corporate Filings) view. Receives a
 batch handed off from the "Download All" button -- either via the
 terminal.mk-dl:// URL protocol or a fallback CSV -- and downloads every
 attachment locally, working around browser popup/CORS limits.
 .
 This is the pure-Python build (runs on the system Python interpreter).
 A self-contained onefile binary is also available, see
 https://github.com/terminal-mk/downloader/releases
